% ** Transformasi Solusi Secara Simbolik
% 
% Kasus perbankan di atas dapat diekstrak rumus murninya oleh sistem simbolik.
>function op(K) &= K*q+R; $&op(K)
 %image% Tugas 2-101.png
% // latex: q\,K+R
>$&op(op(op(op(K)))), $&expand(%)
 %image% Tugas 2-102.png
% // latex: q^4\,K+R+q\,R+q^2\,R+q^3\,R
 %image% Tugas 2-103.png
% Maxima mampu mengenali formulasi turunan deret ukur: latex: K_n = q^n K + R (1+q+\ldots+q^{n-1}) =
% q^n K + \frac{q^n-1}{q-1} R
>&sum(q^k,k,0,n-1); $& % = ev(%,simpsum)
 %image% Tugas 2-104.png
% // latex: \sum_{k=0}^{-1+n}{q^{k}}=\frac{-1+q^{n}}{-1+q}
>function fs(K,R,P,n) &= (1+P/100)^n*K + ((1+P/100)^n-1)/(P/100)*R; $&fs(K,R,P,n)
 %image% Tugas 2-105.png
% // latex: K\,\left(1+\frac{P}{100}\right)^{n}+\frac{100\,\left(-1+\left(1+  \frac{P}{100}\right)^{n}\right)\,R}{P}
